title: $:/themes/awildsort/base/dark-mode-toggle-template
tags: [[$:/tags/ViewTemplate]]

Add the dark mode toggle to your navigation by including this widget:

<$dark-mode-toggle />

You can place it in the topbar, sidebar, or anywhere in your layout. For example, in a custom topbar template:

```
<div class="tc-topbar-right">
	<$dark-mode-toggle />
	<!-- other navigation items -->
</div>
```


